
# ML Pathway - Master Plan

> [!abstract] Governing direction
> This pathway is not a certificate track and not a library survey. It is a capability-development program for Cajun Data / Sailfish Business Tools. Each phase pairs first-principles implementation with applied systems work. Python is the model-development environment; Go is the durable service and deployment layer. The commercial center of gravity is local-first small-business tooling: tabular decision support, document intelligence, retrieval, evaluation, local inference, and appliance-style deployment.

**Core principle:** Every stage must produce both understanding and a reusable Sailfish-relevant asset.

**Pacing:** Self-directed. Progress is gated by comprehension, not by the calendar. A phase is complete when its verification gates pass, not when a set amount of time has elapsed. Do not rush a gate to stay on an imagined schedule, and do not linger in a phase whose gates have already passed.

