## Phase 4 - Embeddings, Retrieval, RAG, and Evaluation

**Libraries:** Sentence Transformers, FAISS or Chroma (NumPy cosine baseline first)

**Order is non-negotiable:** corpus, retrieval, evaluation harness, measured retrieval quality, and only then generation. Eval questions and expected sources come before any demo. Never chatbot-then-vibes.

**Corpus:** fake SOPs plus a price book for the fictional Acadiana Property Services. Do not use my own planning docs as the primary corpus; I wrote them, so retrieval failures would be invisible to me.

Build: multi-chunk-size testing, embeddings, vector index, 30-50 query eval set, recall@k and MRR, keyword-search baseline comparison, then RAG with source-ID grounding and "not found in source material" refusal behavior.

**Gates:** semantic vs keyword baseline compared, retrieval metrics calculated before RAG exists, failure log maintained, answers cite retrieved chunks.

Feeds directly into the Sailfish local knowledge-box / Business Hub story.

