## Phase 7 - Sailfish ML Runtime Capstone

**Tools:** Go, Python, ONNX Runtime, MLflow, llama.cpp/vLLM

Not a portfolio toy: a first internal prototype for the Sailfish Business Hub.

- Go API: `/predict`, `/search`, `/ask`, `/health`, `/models`
- Tabular prediction via the Phase 1 ONNX artifact
- Document search and RAG assistant from Phase 4 on a local LLM
- MLflow lineage / exported model metadata
- Admin view: model version, runtime status, last eval score
- Evaluation endpoint running known test prompts/records with pass/fail
- Local-first packaging (Docker Compose or appliance-style)

Positioning it proves: Python for model development, Go for durable small-business systems, local inference where ownership and privacy matter, hosted where operationally appropriate.

